  <data name="Text_FaqQ2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Does the app execute commands?</value></data>
  <data name="Text_FaqA2" xml:space="preserve"><value>No worries, it does not. It only copies the command, or the command generated from your template values, to your clipboard.</value></data>
  <data name="Text_FaqQ3" xml:space="preserve"><value>How do I open Quick Search?</value></data>
  <data name="Text_FaqA3" xml:space="preserve"><value>Open it with the search button or Ctrl+Shift+Space. Use Up/Down to select, Enter to copy, Ctrl+Enter to view details, and Esc to close.</value></data>
  <data name="Text_FaqQ4" xml:space="preserve"><value>How do template variables work?</value></data>
  <data name="Text_FaqA4" xml:space="preserve"><value>When copying a command, enter values for placeholders such as {name}; they will be substituted before copying.</value></data>
